WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Letting my three-year-old do my skincare.

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.060
Daddy, sit still.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.480
Close your eyes.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:07.860
No peeking.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.560
Is that enough?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.100
No, more.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:15.560
Relax, Daddy.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:16.620
I'm relaxing.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.260
All done, Daddy.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.120
How's my skin?

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.200
So soft.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.620
Did you miss a spot?

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.500
Wait, Daddy.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.580
All better.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:26.560
Thank you, Mia.
